   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Sudan  through the Ministry of Labour and Administrative Reform and the Central Bureau of Statistics carried out a series of &#x201c;rapid LFS in 2020 on the impact of COVID 19. The first and second wave surveys undertaken, which provided inputs for the revision of the National Employment Policy (NEP) of Sudan.


 ILO engaged national and international consultants to undertake the survey using phone interview and disseminating the information to the key partners involved.</narrative>
